    `§17(ה) is in force on` d

-- (ב): §15א is put after §15: for teachers in a primary school with grades
-- 7, 8 or 9 who teach those classes and hold the roles the section lists,
-- the week of §15 applies — and there the scan breaks off (page 5 of the
-- printed agreement is not in it). What the section gives them past its
-- first words is a named input here; the complete copy encodes it.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b
GIVEN `teaches in a primary school with grades 7 to 9` IS A BOOLEAN, `teaches those classes` IS A BOOLEAN, `holds a role §15א lists` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§15א reaches him` `teaches in a primary school with grades 7 to 9` `teaches those classes` `holds a role §15א lists` IF
    `teaches in a primary school with grades 7 to 9` AND `teaches those classes` AND `holds a role §15א lists`

