§§ `11 עובדי הוראה הלומדים לקראת תואר ראשון או תואר שני`

-- akn:art_11 The heading of §11.

-- ¶1: by way of change to §34 of the base agreement, a teaching employee on
-- the reform's terms in a school or kindergarten, studying for a first or
-- second degree and entitled to tuition refunds by the rules as they are
-- from time to time, may choose between fewer frontal hours (an "hours
-- grant") and the refunds. ¶2: once the parties have agreed rules on how
-- many hours, at no cost beyond the refunds'. Until then §34 stands
-- (imported): refunds, and fewer hours only by the exceptions committee.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2
GIVEN `studies for a first or second degree` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled to tuition refunds` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the parties agreed the rules on the hours` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved by the exceptions committee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `year starts` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF `study benefit`
DECIDE `the study benefits open to a reform teacher under §11` `studies for a first or second degree` `entitled to tuition refunds` `the parties agreed the rules on the hours` `approved by the exceptions committee` `year starts` IS
    IF `studies for a first or second degree` AND `entitled to tuition refunds` AND `the parties agreed the rules on the hours`
    THEN LIST `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`
    ELSE `the study benefits open to a reform teacher` `year starts` `approved by the exceptions committee`

`the hours grant may cost more than the tuition refunds` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `the study benefits open to a reform teacher under §11` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014) EQUALS LIST `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`
#ASSERT `the study benefits open to a reform teacher under §11` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2014) EQUALS LIST `tuition refunds`

