§§ `13 עובדי הוראה במכללות ובסמינרים להכשרת עובדי הוראה`

-- akn:art_13 The heading of §13.

-- After the Leon committee's conclusions, and in any case no later than
-- 15.10.2013 (its last day in it, convention dates.end), the parties begin
-- negotiating the reform for teaching employees in colleges and seminars.
-- Time is in days from the signing.
@ref akn:art_13/p1
`days from the signing to 15.10.2013` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 10 2013) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the signing of the September 2013 agreement`

`negotiating the reform for colleges` MEANS
