§§ `14 קביעת רמת המורכבות של בתי הספר ושינוי טבלאות השכר של המנהלים`

-- akn:art_14 The heading of §14.

-- (א): from תשע"ד schools are placed in 8 complexity levels, not the 1–4
-- of §66(א) (imported), and the principals' tables are amended to match.
@ref akn:art_14__para_a
`complexity levels from 5774` MEANS 8

#ASSERT `complexity levels from 5774` GREATER THAN count (`the levels open to` `a primary or junior high school`)

-- (ב): the cost in תשע"ד of the whole change of principals' pay, from the
-- new levels and tables, is no more than 22 million shekels; (ג): in תשע"ה
-- a further change completes it, at no more than 20 million.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b akn:art_14__para_c
`the cost of the new principals' pay in 5774, at most` MEANS 22000000
`the cost of the completing change in 5775, at most` MEANS 20000000

GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER, cost IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within §14's cost` `school year` cost IF
    BRANCH
        IF `school year` EQUALS 2013 THEN cost AT MOST `the cost of the new principals' pay in 5774, at most`
        IF `school year` EQUALS 2014 THEN cost AT MOST `the cost of the completing change in 5775, at most`
        OTHERWISE FALSE

#ASSERT `within §14's cost` 2013 22000000 AND NOT `within §14's cost` 2014 22000000

-- (ד): the parties hold discussions toward agreeing the new tables and the
-- changes to §66 and the other sections concerned; what they agree is
-- anchored in a further collective agreement.
@ref akn:art_14__para_d
`discussing the new principals' tables` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `hold discussions on the new principals' tables and the complexity levels`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `hold discussions on the new principals' tables and the complexity levels`)

-- (ה): (א) and (ב) are implemented only once that agreement is signed, and
-- as the Ministry's preparation allows; then back to the start of תשע"ד.
@ref akn:art_14__para_e
GIVEN `the further agreement is signed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `the new levels and tables apply from` `the further agreement is signed` IS
    IF `the further agreement is signed` THEN JUST `5774 opens on` ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `the new levels and tables apply from` TRUE EQUALS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)

-- (ו): continuing §3 of the follow-up committee's decision of 12.3.2013 —
-- this is the "other arrangement" its §3 leaves room for (imported) — until
-- (ה)'s implementation no change is made in the pay of a principal who goes
-- on running the school he ran in תשע"ג, against the pay he was entitled to
-- in תשע"ג. F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-c: "לא יבוצע כל שינוי" reads, as
-- printed, as a freeze of every change, a rise in seniority or grade or a
-- general raise among them. The reading adopted (convention
-- precedence.heading): the section's heading and its (א)–(ה) are about
-- the complexity levels and the principals' tables, so what is frozen is
-- the complexity level his pay is computed at — the level of his תשע"ג
-- pay, with the תשע"ג supplement the decision gave him.
@ref akn:art_14__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `principal under the 5773 complexity decision`, `still runs the school he ran in 5773` IS A BOOLEAN, `§14(ה) implemented` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the complexity level his pay is computed at under §14(ו)` p `still runs the school he ran in 5773` `§14(ה) implemented` IS
    IF `still runs the school he ran in 5773` AND NOT `§14(ה) implemented`
    THEN JUST (IF `the 5773 complexity decision reaches` p THEN `the level his 5773 pay is computed at` p ELSE p's `level in 5773`)
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `still runs the school he ran in 5773` IS A BOOLEAN, `§14(ה) implemented` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 5773 supplement is paid under §14(ו) on` d `still runs the school he ran in 5773` `§14(ה) implemented` IF
    `the 5773 supplement is paid on` d TRUE (`still runs the school he ran in 5773` AND NOT `§14(ה) implemented`)

#ASSERT `what governs a principal's pay from 5774` TRUE EQUALS `the other arrangement the parties agreed`

-- The principal of the 12.3.2013 example, his school at level 2 in תשע"ד as
-- in תשע"ג: paid at level 3's pay as cushioned, the תשע"ג supplement kept.
#ASSERT `the complexity level his pay is computed at under §14(ו)` `a principal whose school fell with small changes` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `the 5773 supplement is paid under §14(ו) on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2013) TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the 5773 supplement is paid under §14(ו) on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2013) TRUE TRUE

-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-c's evidence: a principal whose grade rose
-- in תשע"ד by 300 a month — as printed he is held to his תשע"ג pay, by the
-- reading he gets the rise.
GIVEN `pay in 5773` IS A NUMBER, `rise in 5774 not from the complexity level` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `his pay under §14(ו), as printed` `pay in 5773` `rise in 5774 not from the complexity level` IS
    `pay in 5773`

GIVEN `pay in 5773` IS A NUMBER, `rise in 5774 not from the complexity level` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `his pay under §14(ו)` `pay in 5773` `rise in 5774 not from the complexity level` IS
    `pay in 5773` PLUS `rise in 5774 not from the complexity level`

`"no change at all" also freezes a rise §14 is not about` MEANS
    NOT `his pay under §14(ו), as printed` 11887.9 300 EQUALS `his pay under §14(ו)` 11887.9 300
#ASSERT `"no change at all" also freezes a rise §14 is not about`

