§§ `17 מיצוי תביעות`

-- akn:art_17 The heading of §17.

DECLARE `matter in the 2013 agreement's term` IS ONE OF
    `a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`
    `an additional economic demand for the term`
    `the reform for teaching employees in guidance roles (§12)`
    `the reform for colleges and seminars (§13)`
    `the reform for a population of §155(ב)` HAS `the population` IS A `population §155(ב) leaves to negotiation`

-- (א): the agreement exhausts every claim on what it settles, for the time
-- to 30.6.2015, and no additional economic demand for its term is
-- negotiated. (ב): save the negotiations of §§12 and 13 and on the reform
-- for the populations of §155(ב) of the base agreement as the completion
-- agreement amended it (imported), less the special-education
-- kindergartens whose hours were longer before the reform and the long-day
-- (יוח"א) kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b
GIVEN m IS A `matter in the 2013 agreement's term`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be negotiated in the 2013 agreement's term` m IF
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN `the reform for teaching employees in guidance roles (§12)` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the reform for colleges and seminars (§13)` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the reform for a population of §155(ב)` pop THEN
            (NOT pop EQUALS `teaching employees in special-education kindergartens with longer hours before the reform`)
        AND NOT pop EQUALS `teaching employees in long-day kindergartens`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`no additional economic demands for the term` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `negotiate an additional economic demand for the 2013 agreement's term`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `negotiate an additional economic demand for the 2013 agreement's term`)

`the claims are exhausted for the time to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2015
#ASSERT `the claims are exhausted for the time to` EQUALS `the September 2013 agreement's period closes on`
#ASSERT `may be negotiated in the 2013 agreement's term` (`the reform for a population of §155(ב)` `Shelach teachers`)
#ASSERT NOT `may be negotiated in the 2013 agreement's term` (`the reform for a population of §155(ב)` `teaching employees in long-day kindergartens`)
#ASSERT NOT `may be negotiated in the 2013 agreement's term` `an additional economic demand for the term`

-- (ג): if the Histadrut signs a framework agreement with the State or the
-- public employers for this agreement's term or part of it, the parties
-- negotiate applying its cost to teaching employees, taking this
-- agreement's cost into account — without taking away from §18.
@ref akn:art_17__para_c
GIVEN `a Histadrut framework agreement is signed for the term` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the parties must negotiate a framework cost` `a Histadrut framework agreement is signed for the term` IF
    `a Histadrut framework agreement is signed for the term`

`negotiating a Histadrut framework cost` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     MUST  `negotiate applying the cost of a Histadrut framework agreement`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     MUST  `negotiate applying the cost of a Histadrut framework agreement`)

-- (ד): §155(א) of the base agreement no longer applies between the parties.
-- F-ofek-hadash-september-2013-d: the agreement of 22.7.2013 put off the
-- framework's last allocation, made "under §155(א)", to 1.1.2015 (imported)
-- — a day after (ד) ends that clause, and (ד) says nothing of it. The
-- reading adopted (convention reading.consistent): (ד) ends §155(א)'s
-- mechanism for framework agreements to come — (ג) takes its place — and
-- the allocation of 1.1.2015, its rate already fixed by §92(ג) of the
-- completion agreement and its day by the agreement of 22.7.2013, stands.
@ref akn:art_17__para_d
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§155(א) applies between the parties on` d IF
    NOT d `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`

`the deferred allocation is due after §17(ד) ends the clause it is made under` MEANS
        `the last allocation is put off to` `is on or after` `the September 2013 agreement's period opens on`
    AND NOT `§155(א) applies between the parties on` `the last allocation is put off to`
#ASSERT `the deferred allocation is due after §17(ד) ends the clause it is made under`
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` (2.5%) `the last allocation is put off to` EQUALS 6.35%

§§ `18 שקט תעשייתי`

-- akn:art_18 The heading of §18.

-- In the agreement's term neither party, nor a unit of it, strikes or
-- locks out, wholly or partly, or harms the work in another organised way,
-- over what this agreement settles; not over the matters of §17(ב).
@ref akn:art_18/p1
`industrial peace in the 2013 agreement's term` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the September 2013 agreement settles`)

GIVEN m IS A `matter in the 2013 agreement's term`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `industrial peace covers` m IF
    NOT `may be negotiated in the 2013 agreement's term` m

#ASSERT NOT `industrial peace covers` `the reform for colleges and seminars (§13)`

